                                        "metadata":  "",
                                        "title":  "Upgrade to v3.2.9 (testnet)",
                                        "summary":  "Coordinated upgrade to qorechaind v3.2.9. Light node rewards are now paid out continuously every 100 blocks, split by stake and uptime within the 2,000 QOR per month cap; the reward reserve is released and registered nodes receive a one-time credit for the time they ran before this upgrade. Also included: Solana-compatible relay and gateway hardening (per payer quotas, fair sharing, bounded carrier lifetime) and security fixes across the EVM, CosmWasm and Solana-compatible lanes. Gas for existing transaction kinds is unchanged. Node operators must copy the whole lib/ folder of the bundle; the node refuses to start with libraries from another build. Validators stay on v3.2.8 and swap at the plan height.",
